  "body": "Fork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 0757563d).\n\n## What changed\n\n`docs/user-guide/vendor-fixtures.md` (2 bullets in section 6, \"Limits to know\"):\n\n- Fixed jaw opening: the built-in parametric vises are stated as shipped\n  (PR #802, #788) instead of \"not merged yet\".\n- Fixture plate hole grid: stated as shipped (PR #823, #819) instead of\n  \"planned and not available yet\". The \"for now\" sentence is replaced by\n  \"Use Locate part… to place a fixture that is not on a plate grid.\"\n\nVerified with `gh`: PR #802 is MERGED (2026-11-11), PR #823 is MERGED, issues\n#788 and #819 are CLOSED. \"Locate part…\" is a real UI verb (see\n`crates/ui/src/egui_app/locate_tests.rs`).\n\nNot changed: no other \"not merged\" or stale PR statements exist in the file\n(its only `#` references are the ones above). No links added: the workholding\nguide from PR #1269 is not on main, so it is not linked.\n\n## How tested\n\nDocs-only. No code or test changed, so no gate run. Checked by reading the\nrendered sentences against the `gh pr view` results above.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNothing built or rendered beyond the markdown diff.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1270\n",
